    "title": "FET: Connect, Date & Explore",
    "description": "BEING NORMAL IS BORING...\r\nTired of standard dating apps? On FET, we celebrate diversity and openness. Whether you're curious or experienced with alternative lifestyles, you\u2019ll find a welcoming and inclusive community. Connect with others and discover a new way of meeting people!\r\n\r\nFIND YOUR TRIBE\r\nNew to the FET lifestyle or experienced? FET is a safe place to explore and learn about unique interests. We support our community in sharing knowledge and building connections.\r\n\r\nEXPLORE NEW CONNECTIONS\r\nFET is the place to learn more about alternative lifestyles, with events and meet-ups for everyone. Seek out community connections or discover local gatherings tailored to your interests.\r\n\r\nEXPRESS YOUR TRUE SELF\r\nShare your story, upload photos, and connect with like-minded members. Show the community who you are and find your place in our welcoming space.\r\n\r\nSTAY CONNECTED\r\nKeep up with the latest posts, chat with members, and explore profiles easily. With 24/7 messaging, finding new connections is just a tap away.\r\n\r\nPRIORITIZING SAFETY\r\nYour safety is our priority. Verify your profile to build trust in the community, ensuring a secure space for everyone.\r\n\r\nWELCOME TO A NEW WAY OF CONNECTING\r\nOur mission is to be a leading community for those exploring alternative interests. FET is a welcoming space that helps demystify lifestyles and brings people together in a safe, inclusive environment.\r\n\r\nMore details here: https://www.fet-app.com/en/terms\r\nAll personal data is handled under the terms and conditions of FET's privacy policy. More details can be found here: https://www.fet-app.com/en/privacy",
